:: Livestock Plough Refuse
<<effects>><<speechresolve>>

<<if $edenwhip is 0>>
	<<set $edenwhip to 1>>
<</if>>

<<if $worn.face.type.includes("gag")>>
	You remain still, planting your feet and refusing to move.
<<else>>
	<<if (_speechAttitudeResolved is "meek" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy")>>
		"I-I can't pull this," you say, straining against the harness. "I'm too weak."
	<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
		"Please... I can't," you pant. "My body's giving out."
	<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "polite">>
		"I can't pull this," you say through clenched teeth. "It is impossible."
	<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant">>
		"This is an insult to both labour and livestock," you say, voice shaking despite the flourish.
	<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "confident">>
		"This plough isn't moving," you say. "Not because you told me to pull it."
	<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty">>
		"Untie me," you snap. "Or drag it yourself."
	<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel">>
		"Do it yourself," you hiss. "I'm done dancing for you."
	<<else>>
		"이걸 끌 수 없어요." 당신이 말한다. "힘이 충분하지 않아요."
	<</if>>
<</if>>
<br><br>

Remy cracks the whip at your side, letting the sound split the air before <<he>> follows it with a lash across your back. Pain tears a cry from you. "If that's how you want it," <<he>> says, delight curling under every word, "so be it."
<br><br>

You brace for another strike, muscles locking hard enough to shake, but the whip only snaps beside you again as <<he>> toys with the moment.
<br><br>

<<link [[당긴다|Livestock Plough]]>><<sub 1>><<transform cow 1>><<npcincr Remy dom 1>><<tiredness 18>><</link>><<ggtiredness>>
