Remy brings the whip down once more. You grit your teeth as the leather tears across your back, pain flooding your body in brutal waves.
<br><br>
<<if (_speechAttitudeResolved is "meek" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy")>>
	Tears blur your sight, but fear still cannot make your legs obey.
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
	The part of you that wants to be easy and quiet almost wins. Almost.
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "polite">>
	Your breathing breaks into ragged pieces, yet you stubbornly hold your ground.
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant">>
	Whatever elegance you tried to keep is gone, but your refusal remains bright and yours.
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "confident">>
	The field swims in front of you, but you keep your spine straight.
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty">>
	The field swims in front of you, but anger keeps your spine straight.
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel">>
	Each blow only makes the hatred in you burn cleaner.
